{%- comment -%}
  RENEW HERO — the Renew page's video hero (Assets/Lava/Partials/VideoHero.lava,
  Styles/_video-hero.scss).

  Block:                    an HTML block in the Renew page's Feature zone
  Block content:            {% include '~~/Assets/Lava/RenewHero.lava' %}
  Cache Duration:           0
  Page:                     InnerDefault, PageHeaderStyle Hidden, DarkHeader
                            checked, Page Cacheability No-Store (the hero
                            changes with the clock, like the live page)

  The lead line under "Renew" is the page's Description (Page Properties).

  Live swap: on Monday nights, inside the live window below, the hero plays
  the Resi live stream (the same embed as the live page, LiveService.lava)
  with a "Live now" line; the rest of the week, Renew's video (media 1147).
  ROCK: replace the window with a schedule check later, as the live page.

  The page content under it: Resources/PageContent/Renew.html (Main zone).
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- comment -%} ── Settings ─────────────────────────────────────────────── {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign heroMediaId = 1147 -%}
{%- assign resiEmbedId = '692bc6a6-70a1-4fa1-af72-e1a7e7290763' -%}

{%- comment -%}
  Live window (server time), 24-hour HHmm: 1815 = 6:15pm, 1930 = 7:30pm.
  Large Group is 6:30–7:15 PM; the window opens a little before and closes a
  little after so the player is there when the stream starts.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign liveDay       = 'Monday' -%}
{%- assign liveStartTime = 1815 -%}
{%- assign liveEndTime   = 1930 -%}

{%- comment -%} ── Live now? ────────────────────────────────────────────── {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign nowDay  = 'Now' | Date:'dddd' -%}
{%- assign nowTime = 'Now' | Date:'HHmm' | AsInteger -%}
{%- assign heroLive = false -%}
{%- if nowDay == liveDay and nowTime >= liveStartTime and nowTime <= liveEndTime %}{% assign heroLive = true %}{% endif -%}

{%- if heroLive -%}
  {%- comment -%}
    Resi: autoplay needs mute=1 (browsers only autoplay muted video);
    showUnmuteButton is how viewers turn sound on (as LatestMessage.lava).
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- capture heroEmbedHtml -%}
    <iframe allow="autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture" allowfullscreen="true" class="resi-video-frame"
            title="Renew live stream"
            src="https://control.resi.io/webplayer/video.html?id={{ resiEmbedId }}&iframe=1&autoplay=1&mute=1&controls=1&showUnmuteButton=1"></iframe>
    <script defer src="https://control.resi.io/webplayer/page.min.js"></script>
  {%- endcapture -%}
{%- endif -%}

{%- capture heroActions -%}
  <a class="btn btn--primary" href="#next-steps">Find your next step</a>
{%- endcapture -%}
{% include '~~/Assets/Lava/Partials/VideoHero.lava' %}
